          "originalSha256": "a1ced5cb1d01a0da395fc49beefd29586ad57c04b79196d98f1b876e37764565",
          "excerpt": "乾祐二年春正月乙巳朔，制曰："
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v102",
          "paragraphId": "old-v102-p4",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "f40004de84157edd718f7e926c38adbd5f24c54db0e052ecae337bb850572dc5",
          "excerpt": "若能翻然歸順，朕即待之如初，當保始終，享其富貴，明申信誓，固無改移。"
        },
        {
          "chapterId": "old-v102",
          "paragraphId": "old-v102-p4",
          "originalRevision": 1,
          "originalSha256": "f40004de84157edd718f7e926c38adbd5f24c54db0e052ecae337bb850572dc5",
          "excerpt": "候收復城池，罪止元惡，其餘詿誤，一切不問。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "liu-chengyou-tax-relief",
